  1+  9000              ; =========================================================================
  2+  9000              ; PROJECT127 ATM native video service v0.3.0
  3+  9000              ; Confirmed ATM Turbo 2+ RG6 80x25 text framebuffer.
  4+  9000              ; Host code occupies page 5, so video uses the established alternate
  5+  9000              ; framebuffer pages 7 (characters) and 3 (attributes).
  6+  9000              ;
  7+  9000              ; API:
  8+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_Query: A=mode, B=columns, C=rows, HL=frame bytes
  9+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_WriteCell: D=row, E=column, A=character; attr defaults #44
 10+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_WriteCellEx: D=row, E=column, A=character, B=attribute
 11+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_ReadCell: D=row, E=column; returns A=character, B=attribute
 12+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_Clear: clears the 80x25 character/attribute planes
 13+  9000              ;   BufferCreate/Destroy/Clear/Copy: two off-screen packed RG6 buffers
 14+  9000              ;   BufferRead/Write: UINT32 byte ranges between video and transfer handles
 15+  9000              ;   BufferPrepare/Unprepare: pin/unpin a buffer for a future DMA consumer
 16+  9000              ; Buffer payload is 4000 bytes: 2000 interleaved character/attribute pairs.
 17+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_SelfTest: framebuffer write/readback + bounds test
 18+  9000              ; Carry clear = success; carry set = invalid request or test failure.
 19+  9000              ; =========================================================================
